Package: CoCluster
Title: Allows Co-Clustering of Data Using the Latent Block Model with Native Support for CUB Ordinal Data
Version: 0.0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Nam Dang", "VO", , "vonamdang03@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates the optimal co-clustering using the **SEM-Gibbs** algorithm and can automatically search for the optimal number of clusters using a greedy surface search algorithm and the ICL criterion. It leverages the **Latent Block Model** equipped natively with the **CUB** observation model, tailored for ordinal data, and can easily be extended to use other models.
